# Thor enters on turn one and exiles the Lightning Bolt from the graveyard: "Until the end of your next turn, you may
# play that card." Bot1's next turn is turn three, and the Bolt is left alone then (casting it on turn three is
# thor-plays-an-exiled-instant-on-his-next-turn). On turn five, with a Mountain untapped, the Bolt is still in exile
# but can no longer be cast — the permission ended with turn three.

